{'symbol': 'ARE', 'date': '2022-02-22 08:30:00', 'title': 'ALEXANDRIA REAL ESTATE EQUITIES, INC. ANNOUNCES LONG-TERM 334,000 RSF, FULL-BUILDING LEASE FOR THE NEW LILLY INSTITUTE FOR GENETIC MEDICINE AT 15 NECCO STREET IN THE SEAPORT INNOVATION DISTRICT IN GREATER BOSTON', 'text': "PASADENA, CALIF., FEB. 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALEXANDRIA REAL ESTATE EQUITIES, INC. (NYSE: ARE), AN URBAN OFFICE REIT AND THE FIRST, LONGEST-TENURED AND PIONEERING OWNER, OPERATOR AND DEVELOPER\xa0UNIQUELY FOCUSED ON COLLABORATIVE LIFE SCIENCE, AGTECH AND TECHNOLOGY CAMPUSES IN AAA INNOVATION CLUSTER LOCATIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GLOBAL HEALTHCARE LEADER ELI LILLY AND COMPANY HAS SIGNED A 334,000 RSF LONG-TERM LEASE FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF LILLY'S NEW STATE-OF-THE-ART INSTITUTE FOR GENETIC MEDICINE AT 15 NECCO STREET IN THE SEAPORT LIFE SCIENCE SUBMARKET OF GREATER BOSTON."}